The PNG icons in this directory are rasterized from the Lucide icon set
(https://lucide.dev, https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide) with no changes
to their geometry. They were rendered at 128x128 from the upstream 24x24 SVG
sources, with `currentColor` replaced by white so the application can tint
them to any theme color at load time via their alpha channel.

Lucide is distributed under the ISC License, reproduced in full below.

Some Lucide icons are derived from the Feather project and are additionally
covered by the MIT License (Copyright (c) 2013-present Cole Bemis). Of the
icons in this directory, the following are Feather-derived: check,
chevron-down, download, external-link, hash, moon, plus, x.

